{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1517,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abfef37f2687e506b98fd63e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2452670a30426d87a4d948ebde001f06e583a789f5f8d913ea33347f767de96e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:193afbd4c32205c5403fb499",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうなさいました？",
      "source_fingerprint": "382e324f68d619cf5a2a4ed018d9e10e85e6473abd3f45d56c00f2d5835c551b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51b8543e31b271313914a6ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おや、残念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdbee5f925f46d5939579cd54c69e9627fe55c4df089b0e8c2c424d073fd768d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:089e710933de7a25e0837f29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "惜しいですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fe2abc3da56d00993c092f561d7cad51b3524a1923903f840ccde16544f83f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5b4539e8ba736109fe04aa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天我会为您准备这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8246de2c2722b6f157d8fee86c93e37548f1cede2d3327a483206008441fe3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:568eec4155fff732e901eef3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――呼…啊、非常抱歉。\r\n那个…我没事的，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bac688cfbe7d41bd5420cc6578d7b81db24ced7deb4e5df3826f90cfd83f337",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fbe776a3f3e6f8a7e0fe2b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做凡事都不应超过其限度…\r\n您想必也是这么想的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "706fa421cddadbf929ae68d41377ff271e1fcbe6eaf883c76d61d2a8201c8ab1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2ce87f3cc504e70a3ebb4be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…状态正好。感觉离大姐头\r\n所在的地方、又靠近了一些…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "197ec91d3e3863fb9445c9f1490d72613730556eb49c61c8a37f6bcc472061bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be2a80b46e91b894083f6481",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来今天也能进行\r\n一场富有成效的训练呢。\r\n还请多多指教了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "206bb7df67cc37b1e848a869d3ed24b073cea22e083a318bdfeac07c33c8cc47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deb957debd832678cb92406e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小匠的跑法还是如此凌厉、\r\n却又如此美丽…。呵呵;\r\n我也不能落后呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d48e65710504db92763626c5d38af5dcc93b0861576d2aa88c2a82fdbe5828f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d96aceae6690926fd65be0ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您的鼎力相助、\r\n实在的帮了我大忙。\r\n今天也请多多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "453d1b6639beffa1d9d8c7e02e1cb99d4ae4062600c06e783a2dfb0a13849afa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fb7dbf80d8e61ce07883b6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一步一个脚印\r\n稳步前进吧。\r\n毕竟旅途当中，最忌讳焦躁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c218c720412669f34a302f54c546d3f2164f6a63a88e2581019d6dda5873a3c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d73aef32186416a24c891932",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "停滞不前亦有原因――\r\n唯有探明前因后果\r\n方为训练的真谛…您说对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "858eaede725c1111f0b1e18b935a4384bbbde387cebf0338faa9cbf514bcc840",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6bf73a783ba03bd1f4df02c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "讲真、状态说不上很好…。\r\n真是，太不争气了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d7c6daf6afbc48653e982466da5219d1fb5ea7f1b60077e198cc87382c269ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b01f1dfe9967473a5c3f5a64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "针对每种状态的对策\r\n我都已考虑过了。还请\r\n您务必放心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66596d0cb721334c233ba5006f9f5f6ffa2f7e5381fef82d985b5593eef7f978",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e478117abf64174fd3d1667c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以目前的状态，训练效率\r\n恐怕难以符合理想。该如何\r\n应对…能和您商量一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "24dfc35347c637d40335bbe514962766b60bf1a8a9bbf458a1282b807ec945e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc8fa7d502dff09b3330101e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日依旧、只需\r\n按部就班即可。…还有别的事吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1edab2ae83e0232e6beb015bebd037dba1dfb607e441c0594fdfc9103f4eb6f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a3dc999e5eb4ab1dbd96622",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多该聊聊关于\r\n日程安排的事了。来、坐下说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00dcad3b45bbe604ea917f9c62a38e8c39ada332290718f0041889309e2d53de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb8c981b899f0d8db7ed16a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…您明白的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "87f455c8d25fa5280a8a9c10e7ef642079818fa1acb600a4871060df56e57f20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de1e2aa0ffe9acbba3638da9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大姐头曾目睹过的景色…\r\n今天是否也能，窥见到一二呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34574326bd248a0ab957912cbd9b642d2863ce0725c998358f21bcd1caed23c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:692407de646e5f920921bce1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让您体验一下\r\n何为极致的旅程吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "413c4221931e5594b3a0a9383b84a77016234e0a7ddd938a8a59fc27a57cfe8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85c57dac89e65a59f5ab5044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整完毕…您也做得\r\n非常出色。今天我会\r\n让您见证精彩的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99fd1d87c5b9cd0616faa11ebc3256cf09d1fd58bb76a1aee566bebd011af2c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45f3455ac57192ba507a3645",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整万无一失、对手的情报收集\r\n也已周全。接下来…\r\n就只待夺取胜利、了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "404a08d604ecd9bb461c61ab2f2765fb6fb6674581a6ea508b25864c7007c2e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4855538c7b4f2f6101fda054",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利的滋味…那份芳香。\r\n让我们前去尽情享受吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c85abe917ee260aa18f755576fc9bbb21da39916d8294c997c3b57b3932cd47d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7139c282144e91276ef41f3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，身体如此轻盈。\r\n――仿佛能翱翔天际一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65a579eafc7f4e02568eb54d3124641475f4284b5897121a5c372c89cead9473",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc90352f4be78d5de8a431d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就，从容不迫地…\r\n去夺取胜利吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff244ea33b1d2ee59be90ae2942c11edc1b47cd52077381e1526ddf5c173a873",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79209919473fe45fd536523f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该做的都已经做了。\r\n剩下的、便是如何将其尽数发挥…\r\n这就是我自己的问题了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45c2eb38e4de301594739a3f7b657bdb9cd7fd584ce916939ca1cbe5f1d84abc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c4e378a3bacba5066328a7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧张、么。\r\n呵…说得真可爱。\r\n不过是展现实力罢了，仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18db8129f730a0db34032ce63d4eefe68a6c5f73943d24878d456b29cf5dbe7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e80fd3b9208403091ee8cb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整不足…或许这也是\r\n竞赛生涯中常有的事吧。\r\n我会妥善应对的，绝无疏漏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b048d88b7b1eedc17d6939580a4d1db27d404fb3c2932cfb1e73d4b7ebad1177",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d66f01a1053ec2ee2169293",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "复盘和总结留待一切结束之后。\r\n――现在，要全力以赴地\r\n应对眼前的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2cf6d7fcb738a949926ea7ceea8e1398aec681e5ee8c88f0a3705edc652f002",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a9a2a7d1a36a705453dfa4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系、我很集中。\r\n将此刻所能拥有的力量全部倾注于战斗――\r\n这才是面对胜负之事应有的姿态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f5b9f1302a66ecf41871e98b2ea0a57500453e53d6fbf0dd5bf7b38cfbf5fd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cd07d477e72ec0f6dbe297e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼――――…不，\r\n没问题。我们上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cbabf3dbd9b3a827bcb2100ba867ab9fd8861dbbd14923811264d081b4c896c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:807221598655ec2fb7478bf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抱歉。能稍微\r\n给我点集中精力的时间吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "10e0e1f66f30b024beeb659bb98d96b4367444f0feffc5f9c5d1cfd788e4bb4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41565f3509c13a0d685c4774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老实说、这恐怕会是场\r\n严酷的比赛吧。关键在于，能从中\r\n收获到什么，并延续到下一段旅途",
      "source_fingerprint": "5de7865fee309423d75d9decc8d4e02e0afcdc5061cc45a36da604f2ce6482dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8358a871a928c71f51daa41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "639ec917f68ca8864ddb2ad4eb800eccca968da99504ad48a5e78de236d94f73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b8e19f749251b91ec11f4f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "980a7ec4edfa6d1adf15641f4347f9c2840126ff143da4b3a0db3ad63034d737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf3ad8f9517a272e2fc6b9e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无妨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27b932bccdd0e2ec3b6f0fee7d20a5284305f9a8b1bea3ce2f1333ff63447fd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c2d966d0221f28a12c5052d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4e8d20aa5151334b4c38a65a505a9374b636972b6acc835853e25c1ff32890f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc93c32e87a5f206e383c7f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦呦…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05e21e882067c9c68dfaf3854f5a6e207cea3c6fd4f908fde5807a7e4e33d333",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d7c9c6fc188b34db18047a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼ー…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "792d428d32e6aff1af93acf94392326dd285de953367a97221d835d288fc7b0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:270280a4d94cd132d07184cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6662d4dbec001753217e00827e1b11c773577bc67a31875f80338646c5f07bc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5a9f008055bf23279d4ac26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真美…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a785455814559dafa3d633ee605bdc64aee5c169e38e2150ac6790cd53a1801f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a74dcef7861a0dae0aed0055",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "托您的福，度过了一段美好的时光",
      "source_fingerprint": "f33b44cdf06218ed16eebd9ced44f1a9ccba345ce3e677229b8d83bd7b2f355c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6b828696bc8f1a12bfa91af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直以来承蒙您的照顾了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcc04a0652fb43c27c99467499b904aa724498ea1a249ae3fc8a96181de55edd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e9a028ae9f8d7167deff47a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就、全力以赴吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "daf81a5473ecf642223d0961d5883c883eaf4569349870d162ee5fc2d7a0cbfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f22567917a5eb223c391c78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们奉献一场精彩的比赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a25bed0b58c785dccce70855a3a78734e9e7a4620dfc818f328204670c8c538",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17984019286565f8869876a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直以来承蒙您的照顾了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcc04a0652fb43c27c99467499b904aa724498ea1a249ae3fc8a96181de55edd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45c00aa5ead85588f8249bc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，身体如此轻盈。\r\n――仿佛能翱翔天际一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65a579eafc7f4e02568eb54d3124641475f4284b5897121a5c372c89cead9473",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eac4c82a74abbe3f74aa934d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整完毕…您也做得\r\n非常出色。今天我会\r\n让您见证精彩的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99fd1d87c5b9cd0616faa11ebc3256cf09d1fd58bb76a1aee566bebd011af2c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8f90597a38165c84a0a706c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直以来承蒙您的照顾了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcc04a0652fb43c27c99467499b904aa724498ea1a249ae3fc8a96181de55edd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03c698813335d15b4ffc9017",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c1bb480ed0811432e377c03a073021704dea1af4170f367125bc0d9553854df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57da12ca336f4375091e9a2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还算…可以吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69bdbb3929f9b4c354e5623d115a5b842e2d642c1ee3cfe6dce556a28d46a5e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f34f94e071defcba254757db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将经验活用于下一战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd8fc4451c6712251c91edc55828957ef8cd01bb2b201c215808c3645c3e9d83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0867b4c497834af9bc29f51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会尽快制定对策的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f171341df313f1bba90e3de7b157fb2c8e23b269c7b6ce07ad152891ee5e78e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a7892c3221970ad10900301",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这真是何等模样…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3f3d8e8d9405446351592eca5b5fdbb1ce2dd79e560e84e82811536eae87060",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1ea258f2b40b87b4d85c44e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这双引以为傲的腿，其力量…\r\n您可曾好好印入双眼？",
      "source_fingerprint": "673fce39876764c2aeb707b430f4bf0f62f6fc47b527366fd0c236c0f8ba330d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14d01a60cb4fc356c679cecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这极致的旅程…您可曾品味？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8ca81375a36a7c7eb5870b8daa9417d52d1a7cf7f7f7230f9f48f69478f3855",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9951363a0be61f4ab82d8156",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该出发了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4719027dea87e9e0a68efe11c0ca2a779bd0fadc7a1fdeb51189fab13aacb6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:360b93f8f7b7fc0b6b67a6c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "启程吧。向着旅途的尽头…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4859230b12805e0612ae4678686b08c0d2022c7a594a5bbca533cf6f9b50e15d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:863ca196b5c0c384e0f0c4ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时机正好。就由我带您踏上…这如梦似幻般的\r\n极致之旅。来吧――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f38854f6acb74c53e4f53f106a6e1b54cc2d4b81dfc927b9d855b683406a09be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bb54ad17be210f7ba252407",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请由我为您献上梦幻般的舞台吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3417b04cb24641b1a33eb1f9f9b417e0add827916c8c504c044681b364476fa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d337ef930adec2ee2b5576f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向粉丝们致以最诚挚的感谢之情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a2edfda92c2841478abd56ab971b4a13323b7c662f74f2a77ea4afbec21a06e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc4a7bf9a77f90fa1c3ee11b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一起去见证旅途的尽头吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cef4d8054d2860e4bfcfca2d0f444192738725dfc39e844caef68987b613a29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df5d7a30db873ada8634407e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您的温柔给了我\r\n莫大的支持。对我而言、\r\n您是无可替代的人…训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "46701983f51ab83931d948736804a2f245bc385259533273529ca0ef25fdc769",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e76057615aecf2115c98f0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "保养我每天都有在做哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d6b08ff48ab6bbdc28f1ef607ad159ca875c4c94719e4a4fa7b583bae959998",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcc83c74b5d3224c937feac2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是件不太常穿的设计呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "998524118313db8c6c599c23e7c398cde45fccb01b540cc7e688a41f48b4f78c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52bbdc987cef06429c22f7ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟平时给人的印象有所不同吗？\r\n…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "685eb4d472db0669db808bfcdcb7aee448095e67b7ab939bac65370b5ad9d6d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25256bd51b9d4b3527d388ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服…真是便利的符号。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eae7a2b7c6c7d63c2a79ec3c3145d1ad72c2aa80174109e0700a886061e907fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5025d8f41ac8dd54c148032a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我算是比较擅长记舞步的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8781d076a0a36f1fb5f2492665dd95624268f10f711bb027f6c3784d6a7822c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ee700c613290451091e1854",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的骄傲…这就请您过目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f78401dcdb094c05b0d1d52c903f193a1f2887c46db357dbda778875119dccc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06a8435ad73146b20023e00c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白色很让你感到意外吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03e48faa73bf16b65fc89d0a225c3c97f8ac582d1d55436dde52b7bb8a0377a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77504921df90bff11d0c119f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宴会之上 享受者才是赢家；不是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6db296f10ec5d631e959518ef57632e79058fee72652ad2221c9cdb4b70a8e8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef8451e8ef35598fe38abd83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须根据用途，来区分使用呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac7baffadf7df822349a280ed0ccd62632f5915f6899a6c0d79bc83c9dc72b09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae8a6a03661cebb67831c9c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够驾驭的服装，其实并不多呢…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8170c83e93c248caa71992d7568bea8921c95d21cc96a1e20c579b6fd1d53f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14cc78a4a7a3a123ab866d13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "保养我每天都有在做哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d6b08ff48ab6bbdc28f1ef607ad159ca875c4c94719e4a4fa7b583bae959998",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66f6cee044d6eefe1c6a7887",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是件不太常穿的设计呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "998524118313db8c6c599c23e7c398cde45fccb01b540cc7e688a41f48b4f78c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d3d8f962742f2d404786f5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟平时给人的印象有所不同吗？\r\n…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "685eb4d472db0669db808bfcdcb7aee448095e67b7ab939bac65370b5ad9d6d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1de40e55e37675c7a2b19ea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服…真是便利的符号。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eae7a2b7c6c7d63c2a79ec3c3145d1ad72c2aa80174109e0700a886061e907fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28159904f80a4203489c26f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我算是比较擅长记舞步的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8781d076a0a36f1fb5f2492665dd95624268f10f711bb027f6c3784d6a7822c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60d08d9bbf7f95ab994ea236",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的骄傲…这就请您过目。",
